al cases inside one module (one output contract for all paths) and restores the MISSION.md rich-citations guarantee that exports keep every cited chunk's snippet.\",\"The marker-placement invariant keeps '- ' emission inside formatCitation exactly where the valid paths at lines 35 and 58 already emit it, so formatSources' header and newline join stay untouched and no double-marking or caller-side marker logic can appear.\",\"Guards AC-5 through AC-8 pin the valid paths, both console.warn messages, and the empty-snippet early return, so the fix cannot silently regress kept behaviour; static trace of the current tests confirms they still pass post-fix (e.g. the Dynamous no-lesson_url case's not.toContain('](') holds for '- title — range').\",\"No policy conflict anywhere: the target file carries no no-growth debt, and the design adds no cross-layer coupling, no wrong-direction layer edge, and no speculative extension point over the multi-ticket horizon.\"],\"required_changes\":[],\"source_files\":[\"MISSION.md\",\"app/frontend/src/App.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/__tests__/ChatArea-handleCitationClick.test.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/__tests__/ChatArea-refreshConversationsRef.test.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/__tests__/ChatArea-strictmode-first-send.test.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/__tests__/VideoExplorer-admin-gate.test.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/__tests__/VideoExplorer.test.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/__tests__/adminApi.test.ts\",\"app/frontend/src/components/ChatArea.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/components/CitationModal.test.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/components/CitationModal.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/components/Message.test.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/components/Message.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/components/Sidebar.test.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/components/Sidebar.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/components/VideoExplorer.tsx\",\"app/frontend/src/hooks/useAdminVideos.test.ts\",\"app/frontend/src/hooks/useAdminVideos.ts\",\"app/frontend/src/hooks/useConversations.test.ts\",\"app/frontend/src/hooks/useConv